        "original_id": "8e56f635-d241-5f25-929b-32ec22568934",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Judy Greer, Mitchell Hurwitz, Zach Galifianakis\n- TV series: Arrested Development, It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia, Californication, Archer\n- Films: Visioneers\n- Places: Newport Beach, Culver City, Marina del Rey\n\nFacts:\n- Arrested Development is an American television sitcom created by Mitchell Hurwitz.\n- Arrested Development originally aired on Fox for three seasons from November 2, 2003, to February 10, 2006.\n- Arrested Development is set in Newport Beach, California.\n- Arrested Development was filmed primarily in Culver City and Marina del Rey.\n- Judy Greer is best known on television for playing Kitty Sanchez on Arrested Development.\n- Judy Greer is best known on television for playing Ingrid Nelson, also called Fatty Magoo, on It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia.\n- Judy Greer is best known on television for playing Trixie on Californication.\n- Judy Greer is best known on television for playing Cheryl Tunt on the animated comedy series Archer.\n- Visioneers stars Zach Galifianakis and Judy Greer.",
